    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yeremiya ghwasha madamnyeanda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'asheanji ghwahidu heeda Yeremiya nea gwaleabu heeda NG'UTAMIIDA, gweaydeaba damanamughuush bea Sedekiya was sugoocheanda Yuda, nea abeeda ea gweaydeaba damasis gil bea sugoocheanduumeeda Nebukadinesa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwaneaweesa Yerusalemu lugooda sugoocheanda Babeli, nea Yeremiya was sibaneeda abeeda ea sirasa jeeda seamooda furiischoodiga mida jeeda ghooriida sugoocheanda Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda Sedekiya was sugoocheanda Yuda gwajaksa ghealooniga Yeremiya nea gwayi, “Ghwasaan anda giramoarani nea giyeeni, ‘Gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA, Ng'ula, gaydayiin mujiineani geatinda sugoocheanda Babeli ak gayghoang'waay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea Sedekiya was sugoocheanda Yuda ea mayghaghu aba geatinga fuga Galdayo",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32:4",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Galdayo gheawunga suuk geeguura Babeli.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", ak aba huumwa gajeayiin geatinda sugoocheanda Babeli, ak gabalool nea gwadeaschi ak gaygwaroonyi ak gabalool sea niny nea gang'ula geat gheanyaga nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gayghwaat Sedekiya ea ghwahita Babeli, ak gaygoobiida hoowa ea dawa danyasa niny hoowa, gwarugu NG'UTAMIIDA eara ang'ucheewana fuga Galdayo, mayghwajoar.’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayi Yeremiya, “Goobaloolan NG'UTAMIIDA nea gwayi: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ula, Hanameli orjeeda Shalumu was orjeeda ghamageamadu gayghwahidu headaang'u ak gwayi, ‘Shaaha madamnyeandeanyu mida Anatoti aba gideaba giitinooda gwadoobiiwseey asi shaaha.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwahidu heedeanyu Hanameli was orjeeda dea ghamiiyya aba jeeda doodooda furiischoodiga gawuurji gidanyaashta ng'asheanda NG'UTAMIIDA ak gwayeeshiinean, ‘Eaniyean shaaha madamnyeandeanyu mida Anatoti mida ng'eanyiida Benjamini, atina ak gigeandi ghoah daang'u, nea eara giitinooda gwadoobiiwseey asi shaaha.’ Ak geajeeng'u gideaba ng'asheanji nih ng'asheanda NG'UTAMIIDA gil.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Hean ghaashaayi madamnyeandida mida Anatotiin, aba heeda Hanameli orjeeda dea ghamiiyya, ak ghaadawji lapiyeadaanyi shekeelaji damanispwa bea lapiya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghaang'udi mooneeda barawajeandida bea sheayeedean nea gearoorji nea geaguursi mushoodiga ak geadeanyi lapiyeadaanyi aba gidida siiteeniidean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean geageandi barawajeandida bea sheayeedean ghayi mideawa deaweedean ea barawajeanda nuut dea ghayi sibasiinyi niirja nea ea mii radaat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghaadawji barawajeandida bea sheayeedean Baruku was orjeeda Neriya bea orjeeda Maaseya aba madeeda Hanameli orjeeda dea ghamiiya, ea madeeda muushoodigiga ghayi ng'uda mooneeda barawajeandida bea sheayeedean, aba madeeda fuga Yahudi sean abiitpiit aba doodooda furiischoodiga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeesha Baruku aba madeanyaawa: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "‘Gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA bea lugweega was ASEETA Israeli, geani barawajeesu bea sheayeedean barawajeanji ghayi siirooriin ea nih mii radaadiini, ak giyiini jeeda dabicheanda sisna sheang'weeda ak goobiida hoowa eawoojiga saang'a. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA lugweega was ASEETA Israeli, gealga ea madameega, ea madameega sabiibu gajeasha gicha aba jeedeaba ng'eanyiini.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mooshta Yeremiya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Iidu nea naadawji Baruku was orjeeda Neri barawajeandida bea sheayeedean, hean geamuschi NG'UTAMIIDA nea geayeeshi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "‘Ea NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA, ng'ula ang'iing'i gibwadi humng'eeda ea ng'eanyiida aba uurdaang'u haw ea aba geatindaang'u doabiiwaat manda ng'asheanda hang'waay miimuusi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ang'iing'eeda inyeesa gibwaydi fuga as sagalamnyoojiga saang'a nea inyeesa giirgweaksi buuneeda aba riing'eega ghweaniga nyaawa guwoosi ASEETA haw nea guwoosi haw uur, NG'UTAMIIDA bea lugweega gheawungaagu gil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dea haw aba girgweaksiinda buuneeda, ak ghoamu sinooda, nea gheanyangaaschi ea nijaada aba naweadinga sean bea buuneeda, ak ghoadaw giliwas sih aba giteena naweadingaaschi ea giteena haghweega sinaweagaaschi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ang'iing'eeda iyiini gwadeagooda ea ng'asheega deamdeameadi jeeda ng'eanyiida Misri ea ghoah ghamneawa, jeeda fuga Israeli ea bugusta eemoojiga sean, nea gwasissa geaw gheawunga gawuurji gideaba ghamneawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea giiruuni fugaagu was Israeli ng'eanyiida Misri aba gwadeagooda ea aba ng'asheega deamdeameadi ea aba geatinda haw uur ea geatinda doabiiwaat ea aba gharbeeda haw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak giidawi saawa ng'eanyiini ghayi iyeaksi habeawooda ghweaniga nyaawa gideaba gajadawa ng'eanyiida nyiit eanooga ea maleeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gaweay jeedeaba ng'eanyiita ak goombal, ak ea mooleeyseey iit nea mwaang'waanya deaweedeadaang'u, nea manda ng'asheanda nisin aba jeedeaba giika ghayi iyeeshi sinnean, nea aba badaydeaba nih ea ninung' ghoang'waay ng'asheesu munyas seaniin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ula ng'asheesu gaweesa mujiineani ghoang'waay, ak mujiineani ea siyiin geatinga fuga Galdayo ng'uchi sea saawa, ak ng'uta, ea geejeeda, ea dawni, suh irguuni nisa, asi ng'ula ang'iing'i nidaah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ea NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA, giyeeshiinean “shaaha madamnyeandida aba lapiya nea giguursi muuwshoodiga”– ak earapeadi mujiineani gajeayiin geatinga fuga Galdayo.’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwahidu ng'asheanda NG'UTAMIIDA heeda Yeremiya ak gwayeesha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ng'ula, aniini geawooschi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA, fuga sean heapi gwanda ng'asheanda hang'waay was sean mwaamuusi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA, ng'ula, gaydayiin mujiineani geatinga fuga Galdayo ea geatinda Nebukadinesa sugoocheanda Babeli, ak ghoang'waay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak fuga Galdayo ng'uchi sea mujiineani gayghapka ak ghang'uda beasta mujiineani ea goosha, sea gealgaaschi nea uhuuda ghoorajeagaaschi ea sijooysa Baali haleanjeeda sisapa geadi siing'andiita, nea geataw aseecheeka haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi sileeha, siihiida aba gideaba niinyareasan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba orjooga Israeli ea orjooga Yuda nisinnean gea munyas aba madeedeanyu, ghang'eada gheareemaneanduumeeda nyaawa, aba gideaba orjooga Israeli niisaajan aba sinaweega geatinga nyaawa, gwarugu NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba mujiineani ning'udanaan nyarasta ak ea goola goonyareesean ghang'eada damanda ghayi deasa ea ghoah ghamneawa, ak gaydageandeawa madeedeanyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea aba ng'asheega munyas bea orjooga Israeli ea orjooga Yuda, ghayi sin ak ghoanyareasan saawa ea sugoodiga nyaawa, ea fuga nyaawa hees ea ashoohoodiga nyaawa ea sibanga nyaawa, ea fuga Yuda, ea fuga Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ea ninung'usean heeda nea mabiiksean, earapeadi aanalji saawa, inyeesa geabean dawa deanealshi, ak ea mooleeysiiniit giinealshooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea ghwayiin ng'asheega nyaawa munyas jeeda gheeda sing'assa gheawungeasu ak ghang'uda ririnnyeanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea gwadeeksa Baali heeda wagiida, mida jeeda moangoachiyda orjeeda Hinomu ak goosiik orjooga nyaawa ea haweega nyaawa jeeda beasta aba badayda Moleki ng'asheanda miidarukusa nea miigawa eara jeeda gurooroodeanyu gideaba gwasin ng'asheesu munyasiin aba gideaba ghwanung' goodiiy fuga Yuda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Heeleeda rarooda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Asi gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA, bea Israeli, aba badayda mujiineani oobalooli agooga badaydaanyi ng'asheesu nea gooyeenyi, ‘Siyiinyi geatinda sugoocheanda Babeli aba ng'uta, ea geejeeda ea dawni’. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gaydabwada geat saawa ghang'eada mujiinajeega sean ghayi eadearsi saawa aba nyarasteanyu ea sawanadeedeanyu ea aba nyarasteanyu haw, ak gaydeadu gicha hiji ak gaydanung' goobiitpiit nea gaba seayu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gayghoah fugeasu nea geawooschi ASEETA nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaydaadaw saawa gurooroanagi, ea naweanagi, ak gayghoawal gheang'daang'u damanda manda muudeanooda aba miyeasnacheeka nyaawa ea miyeasnacheeka diibiga nyaawa iing'ata saawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea gaydasin neajeeda manda muudeanooda sea saawa, gideaba maydayam geaw nea maydanung'wa heeda, ak gaydasima gea miyaas, ak gaydasin gheawalmeedeanyu jeeda gurooruunatka nyaawa aba gideaba ea mwayamwa geat ghwanung'wanaan heeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaydahoosan dasisa saawa gea miyaas, nea gaydanung' goobiida saawa jeedeaba ng'eanyiini, aba doobiiwnata, aba gurooroodeanyu sean ea jeedeanyu sean.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.41"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aba gideaba gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA aba gideayeateaydi ng'asheega munyas sean hees badaydeaba fiisu, asi gaydeadu ng'asheega miyaasiin sean badahuuka nyaawa ghayi eaheeleesi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gajeasha madameega aba jeedeaba ng'eanyiini oobalooli nea gooyeenyi nih raghoonyeanda gil manda siida nea manda eara diyeayda siyiin geatinga fuga Galdayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Madameega gajeashaaha lapiya nea barawajeanda sishaaha gajeang'waar ak geayiin mooneeda nea geeguursa muushoodiga aba jeeda ng'eanyiida Benjamini ea meadajeega sean bea Yerusalemu ea jeeda mujiinajeega Yuda ea mujiinajeega ng'eanyiida heayeeniga, ea mujiinajeega Shefela, ea jeeda mujiinajeega Negebu; aba gideaba gaydeadeelu fuga nyaawa bea ghealooniga gwarugu NG'UTAMIIDA.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.44"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
